  <dashboards>
    <dashboard name='Q1' type='storyboard'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='964' maxwidth='1016' minheight='964' minwidth='1016' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98340' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98426' x='787' y='830'>
            <zone h='5187' id='3' type-v2='title' w='98426' x='787' y='830' />
            <zone h='10477' id='4' is-fixed='true' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard-nav' w='98426' x='787' y='6017' />
            <zone h='82676' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard' w='98426' x='787' y='16494'>
              <flipboard active-id='1' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point captured-sheet='' id='1' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='42427' id='6' story-point-id='1' type-v2='text' w='96457' x='787' y='16494'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Q1 Explain the difference between a Tableau Dashboard and a Tableau Story Point. Give two healthcare-related use cases.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12' italic='true'>Answer</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>:- A Tableau Dashboard is used for interactive data analysis by combining multiple visualizations in a single view, whereas a Tableau Story Point is used to present data insights in a sequential and narrative format. In healthcare, dashboards help monitor hospital performance in real time, while story points are useful for communicating patient trends and treatment outcomes to stakeholders.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{960EEA72-20B7-4255-A081-10227A2B28D9}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard name='Q10' type='storyboard'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='964' maxwidth='1016' minheight='964' minwidth='1016' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98340' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98426' x='787' y='830'>
            <zone h='5187' id='3' type-v2='title' w='98426' x='787' y='830' />
            <zone h='10477' id='4' is-fixed='true' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard-nav' w='98426' x='787' y='6017' />
            <zone h='82676' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard' w='98426' x='787' y='16494'>
              <flipboard active-id='1' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point captured-sheet='' id='1' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='66390' id='6' story-point-id='1' type-v2='text' w='96457' x='1772' y='15768'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Q10 Based on your visuals, answer: </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Which department generates the highest treatment cost? </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12' italic='true'>Answer</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>:- The </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Neaurology</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> department generates the highest treatment cost, indicating it handles the most expensive treatments and contributes significantly to hospital revenue.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Which region has more critical patients? </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12' italic='true'>Answer</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>:- The </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>South</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'> region has the highest number of critical patients, suggesting higher healthcare demand or more severe case inflow in that area.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>What business decisions can hospital management take from these insights?</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12' italic='true'>Answer</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>:- Based on these insights, hospital management should focus on optimizing costs in high-expense departments, allocating more resources to high-demand regions, improving treatment quality, and leveraging top-performing doctors to enhance overall efficiency and patient outcomes.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{23EFEDA9-EE0B-4A47-B319-AEE708B6CF02}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard name='Q2' type='storyboard'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='964' maxwidth='1016' minheight='964' minwidth='1016' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98340' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98426' x='787' y='830'>
            <zone h='5187' id='3' type-v2='title' w='98426' x='787' y='830' />
            <zone h='10477' id='4' is-fixed='true' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard-nav' w='98426' x='787' y='6017' />
            <zone h='82676' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard' w='98426' x='787' y='16494'>
              <flipboard active-id='1' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point captured-sheet='' id='1' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
